Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1850
Set Height 1000
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 30
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Framerate 60
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.5
Set Theme "rose-pine-moon"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Env COLORTERM "truecolor"
Env TERM "xterm-256color"
Output reel-auto.mp4
Output reel-auto.gif
Hide
Type "lilbee-tui"
Enter
Sleep 80s
Show
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+g
Sleep 7s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "i"
Sleep 400ms
Type "How does lilbee split a large model across multiple GPUs?"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 85s
Sleep 2s
